{
  "date": "2026-11-11",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "谷歌钱包上线新功能，可以用Alipay+在海外扫码付款",
  "title_en": "Google Wallet launches a new feature to scan and pay abroad through Alipay+",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月10日，移动支付网报道，谷歌钱包推出了一个叫“Traveler QR”的新功能。安卓手机用户把Google Play服务更新到26.44版本以后，就能用这个功能。",
      "en": "On November 10, Mpaypass reported that Google Wallet has launched a new feature called \"Traveler QR\". Android phone users can use the feature after updating Google Play services to version 26.44."
    },
    {
      "zh": "有了这个功能，用户在国外旅行时可以扫二维码付款。它用的是蚂蚁国际的Alipay+跨境支付网络。Alipay+把很多国家和地区的电子钱包和商户连接在一起。",
      "en": "With this feature, users can pay by scanning QR codes while travelling abroad. It uses Ant International's Alipay+ cross-border payment network. Alipay+ links e-wallets and merchants in many countries and regions."
    },
    {
      "zh": "报道说，第一批可以用的地方是东南亚几个热门旅游国家，比如马来西亚、菲律宾和印度尼西亚。用户可以扫商户的码，商户也可以扫用户的码。",
      "en": "According to the report, the first places where it can be used are several popular travel countries in Southeast Asia, such as Malaysia, the Philippines and Indonesia. Users can scan a merchant's code, and merchants can also scan the user's code."
    },
    {
      "zh": "手机发现用户到了支持的国家或地区以后，用户可以在钱包的设置里自己打开这个功能，并给它需要的权限。这样，用户不用下载当地的支付App，也能在数百万家Alipay+合作商户付款。",
      "en": "Once the phone detects that the user has arrived in a supported country or region, the user can turn on the feature themselves in the wallet's settings and give it the permissions it needs. This way, users can pay at millions of Alipay+ partner merchants without downloading a local payment app."
    }
  ],
