      "en": "to scan a (QR) code",
      "note": "Short for 扫二维码. Common phrases: 扫码支付 (scan-to-pay), 扫码付款, 主扫 / 被扫 (customer scans merchant code / merchant scans customer code), 扫码点餐 (order food by scanning).",
      "examples": [
        {
          "zh": "在中国，很多小店只支持扫码支付。",
          "py": "Zài Zhōngguó, hěn duō xiǎo diàn zhǐ zhīchí sǎomǎ zhīfù.",
          "en": "In China, many small shops only accept scan-to-pay."
        },
        {
          "zh": "服务员说，扫码就可以点菜了。",
          "py": "Fúwùyuán shuō, sǎomǎ jiù kěyǐ diǎn cài le.",
          "en": "The waiter said you can order just by scanning the code."
        },
